==== a cast names its target type
it as string
----
(cast it "string")

==== casts chain leftward
it as string as lowercase
----
(cast (cast it "string") "lowercase")

==== a cast target may be a multi-word type name
it as trimmed string
----
(cast it "trimmed string")

==== a cast binds tighter than comparison
it as string = "x"
----
(bin "=" (cast it "string") (str "x"))

==== a cast applies to a whole of chain
name of it as lowercase
----
(cast (of (ref "name") it) "lowercase")

==== parens keep a cast inside an of chain
(it as string) of x
----
(of (cast it "string") (ref "x"))

==== a literal casts like anything else
"1.2" as version
----
(cast (str "1.2") "version")

==== a cast target must be a name
it as 5
----
ERROR line 1 column 7

==== a cast target may be a word that starts an operator
x as starts
----
(cast (ref "x") "starts")
